{"id":136243404253045,"name":"[NEW UPDATE!] SURVIVE FOLK VALLEY HOTEL","desc":"Welcome to SURVIVE FOLK VALLEY HOTEL\n\nRESTART = UPDATE\n\nHide from monsters and collect eyes to complete the Round. Grab your friends and work together to defeat the monsters that Arrive when night strikes, Beware as each round buffs the monsters speed and power.\nWhen the player survives the round, you will gain coins for surviving the night. If you die and survive after, you will get coins but not as much. \nUse coins to buy gears and defeat the monsters. defeating a monster gives a huge reward of coins to players.\n\nCurrent Monsters in game ( 9 )\n\n(⚠️WARNING⚠️)\nThis game is in testing phase for right now , so if players experience bugs please report them in our server down below. \nDuring This phase players who played during testers/people who played on release will be rewarded with a title and maybe some other gifts. \n\nThank you for playing and most of all have fun!\n\nRESTART = UPDATE\n","path":"/game/136243404253045-new-update-survive-folk-valley-hotel","slug":"136243404253045-new-update-survive-folk-valley-hotel","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-089ec457082eafc0c9b365634875910a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0a04d015f7cc0e01850b63cf71e81c09/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":20,"visitor":426182,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-17T14:21:33.533Z","creator":{"name":"Adamadam_1234","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"NEW-UPDATE!-SURVIVE-FOLK-VALLEY-HOTEL-Keyless-hub-228567","_id":"6aabcc492ffd843cfde1d087","title":"Keyless hub","game":{"_id":"6aabcc492ffd843cfde1d086","gameId":136243404253045,"name":"[NEW UPDATE!] SURVIVE FOLK VALLEY HOTEL","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-0a04d015f7cc0e01850b63cf71e81c09-aad8316982e2.png","placeId":136243404253045},"features":"Keyless scripthub made by me 😎\nAlso credit me if u make a